+### 2.3 install 端到端序列（伪代码，供 A18 W14+ 实施 wave）
+
+```text
+plugin_install(id, manifest, resource_path):
+  1. parse manifest  (validate_plugin_manifest)            # W6 freeze: schema + bound_text + capability whitelist
+  2. if min_app_version < app_version:                     # FM-7
+        state = Validating.fail; audit(ValidatingFailed); notify_ui; return Err
+  3. if plugins_dir/<id>/<manifest.version>/ already exists: # FM-6 升级路径
+        return Err(PluginAlreadyInstalled)                 # 升级走 W13 plugin_storage_preserve 流程
+  4. state = Discovered -> Validating
+  5. verify_plugin_signature_structure(manifest.signature)  # W6 freeze 纯函数
+  6. if keyring lookup(manifest.signature.key_id) is None:    # FM-2
+        state = SignedFailed; audit(SignedFailed: key_id 缺失); notify_ui; return Err
+  7. if !ed25519_verify(manifest.hash, manifest.signature.value, pubkey):  # FM-5 真验签
+        state = SignedFailed; audit(SignedFailed: ed25519 verify fail); notify_ui; return Err
+  8. state = SignedOk
+  9. extract resource -> plugins_dir/<id>/<manifest.version>/tmp/   # atomic_write 模式
+ 10. if sha256(resource) != manifest.hash:                            # FM-6
+        cleanup tmp; state = LoadFailed; audit(LoadFailed: hash 不一致); return Err
+ 11. rename plugins_dir/<id>/<manifest.version>/tmp -> final         # atomic_write (tmp+rename)
+ 12. state = Loaded
+ 13. audit(Installed: {id, version, key_id, hash 前 16 hex, capability_count})
+ 14. notify_ui(PluginManager.vue -> Discovered 列表新增)
+ 15. return Ok(PluginSummary { id, version, state: Loaded })
+```
+
+### 2.4 enable 端到端序列（伪代码）
+
+```text
+plugin_enable(id):
+  1. 读取 plugins_dir/<id>/<version>/manifest.json        # 必须 Loaded 状态
+  2. if state != Loaded && state != Disabled:
+        return Err(PluginStateTransition)                  # FM-3 类错误
+  3. 对 manifest.capabilities 逐项检查 capability.rs 白名单
+     任一不在 PLUGIN_CAPABILITY_V1 + 任一 reason 含凭据 → return Err
+  4. if 任何 capability.acl_level >= Dangerous:            # capability_acl_level
+        走两段式确认闸门（PermissionPreviewModal.vue，参考 A3 W3 bridge.rs:688-790）
+        用户拒绝 → audit(EnableDenied) + return Err
+        接受 → 触发 keyring 二次认证（参考 M5-10 §4.5）
+        keyring 失败 → audit(KeyringFailed) + return Err
+  5. 注册 capability 到 plugin 作用域（**不**写入 host 自身 capability.rs 全局，**仅** plugin 域）
+  6. state = Enabled
+  7. audit(Enabled: {id, version, capabilities, dangerous_count, keyring_used: bool})
+  8. notify_ui(PluginManager.vue -> 状态徽章变绿)
+  9. return Ok
+```
+
+### 2.5 disable 端到端序列（伪代码）
+
+```text
+plugin_disable(id):
+  1. if state != Enabled && state != Disabled:
+        return Err
+  2. 解除 capability 注册（plugin 作用域）
+  3. state = Enabled -> Disabled
+  4. audit(Disabled: {id, version})
+  5. notify_ui(状态徽章变灰)
+  6. return Ok
+```
+
+### 2.6 list / get 端到端序列（只读）
+
+```text
+plugin_list(filter?):
+  1. 扫描 plugins_dir/<*>/*/manifest.json（不递归深入）
+  2. 对每个 manifest 还原 state + 校验 hash 头 16 hex
+  3. 按 filter {state? | capability? | has_update?} 过滤
+  4. 输出 PluginSummary[]（**仅** id/version/display_name/state/capabilities_count/hash 前 16 hex）
+  5. 不写审计（只读）
+  6. return Ok(List)
+
+plugin_get(id):
+  1. 读 plugins_dir/<id>/<version>/manifest.json
+  2. 输出 PluginDetail { id, version, display_name, description, min_app_version,
+                         entry, capabilities[逐项{capability, reason, acl_level, verdict}],
+                         hash, signature.status (OK|FAIL|MISSING), resource_size,
+                         state, last_50_audit_summaries(key_hash_only) }
+  3. 禁折叠（与 W10 §6 详情页禁折叠一致）
+  4. 不写审计
+  5. return Ok(Detail)
+```
